//--------------------------------
//          Start 
//--------------------------------
title: Start
---
Narrator: This is doodlefish bay, your little slice of heaven. You spend your days drawing silly fishes amongst food and other doodles.
<<NextCamera>>
Narrator: Your doodle album day by day comes alive with so many ideas and colors.
<<NextCamera>>
Narrator: One day a rainy cloud arrived over your island. You forgot your drawing album under the nearby tree as you ran for cover.
<<NextCamera>>
Narrator: You look outside as it began thundering, it seems a bolt came down and has hit your book. Suddenly colors radiate, flying everywhere.
<<NextCamera>>
Narrator: It's your doodles! They are alive and jumping out of the book!
<<NextCamera>>
Narrator: The storm seems to have calmed down. It's time to go collect those silly goobers and bring them back safely to their book.
<<NextCamera>>
<<StopSound LinePresenter>>
<<declare $itemsFound = 0>>
<<declare $quest = "Catch your first doodle fish">>
===

//--------------------------------
//          ItemFound
//--------------------------------
title: ShowItemsFound

---
You found a {$itemsFound} !
=== 

//--------------------------------
//          First Fish Caught
//--------------------------------
title: FirstFish
---
<<if $quest == "Catch your first doodle fish">>
    Narrator: As you catch your first fish, he magically flies into the book stucking to it almost like a sticker.
    Narrator: It moves around the book happy to be back home!
    You: Time to finish this album and bring all of you back home.
    You: When I drew some of my doodles, I made them be picky eaters or obsessed with some items. I should keep an eye out for "bait".
    <<set $quest to "Finish the album">>   
<<endif>>
===

//--------------------------------
//          Album Finished
//--------------------------------
title: AlbumFinished
---
<<if $quest == "Finish the album">>
    You: I did it! All of my Doodle fish are back safe and sound in my drawing album!
    Narrator: The doodles now can stay safe in your book.
    Narrator: Seems like some have adapted to land life like those silly Pants Mackrels
    Narrator: Now you can go back home and enjoy the rest of your days back in doodlefish bay
    <<set $quest to "Enjoy Doodlefish Bay">>   
<<endif>>
===

