//--------------------------------
//      Spring Starter NPC
//--------------------------------

title: SpringStarterNPC
---
Applebottom: That was a scary storm, good thing I have legs, OH! Hey there! I know you. You drew us!
You: I remember you, I called you Pants Mackrel
Applebottom: My friends call me Applebottom, for some reason many of us popped out and we like walking around
You: I'm not sure it's safe for you outside the book...
Applebottom: We can help you but in exchange let us walk around and be free to spread our fish legs!
You: Ok, so how can you help me?
Applebottom: I saw some of the doodles fly far off to the neighbour islands, i know there is a boat in the little makeshift dock nearby
Applebottom: You should go talk to the Pants Mackrel there and he might help you use the boat. Don't forget to collect some of my doodle brothers in this island!
You: Ok i'm on it! Thank Applebottom.
<<EnableMovement>>
<<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

//--------------------------------
//     Autumn Starter NPC
//--------------------------------
title: AutumnStarterNPC
---
    Fishlemor: Welcome to Citron Hill Island. How did you even get here?
    You: ... How did you get here?
    Fishlemor: I'm not even sure, i remember flying off that book and being taken by the wind, some of my brothers and me fell here!
    You: I had some "help" from your pants mackerel brothers back home, I'm trying to collect the other doodles to keep them safe.
    Fishlemor: You should check that bridge nearby. I remember seeing some doodles fall on the river water there!
    You: Thank you, do you know of any more doodles?
    Fishlemor: Uhm... I don't remember anymore but try my brother on the other side of the island, just follow the path past the bridge!
    You: Thanks!
    Fishlemor: Before you go, you got any of them tasty doodle worms? I love sour peach.
    Narrator: You ran off before you could respond to what Fishlemor had just said.
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

//--------------------------------
//     Summer Starter NPC
//--------------------------------
title: SummerStarterNPC
---
    Scorch: Hey buddy, I'm Scorch and welcome to Sunshine Dunes. Where all the doodles come to relax.
    You: Isn't the sun too harsh for doodles? Much less fish?
    Scorch: Every doodle gets a complementary laminated paper sleeve to protect themselfs.
    You: How did you even get the paper? .... Wait, let me guess…
    You: Internet?
    Scorch: Erm… internet.
    You: Well... I can't say im surprised
    Scorch: Regardless, is there anything I can help you with in this little paradise?
    You: Have you seen any doodle fishes?
    Scorch: I think I saw some splashing over at the sea so you should go fish at the shoreline.
    You: Ok, that's perfect! Thanks
    
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

//--------------------------------
//     Spring Bait NPC
//--------------------------------
title: SpringBaitNPC
---
    Doodlas: I have never seen a tree have so many chocolate birds but i'm not complaining. They are so tasty!
    Doodlas: Oh! Hi! I saw you walking around the island and talking to my brothers.
    You: Ya, i'm trying to get the doodle fishes back into the album but I can't seem to find CMGaTO
    Doodlas: That little rascal is being lazy on his project and is hiding... You should try to use a chocolate bird as bait.
    Doodlas: He loves them! But he will be hard to catch so I need to make sure you are ready!
    Doodlas: Catch both the doodle fishes present in the lake, once done come back and I will give you a chocolate fish!
    Doodlas: If you find out you have already caught them somehow, just talk to me again and show me the album!
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: SpringBaitNPCIncomplete
---
    You: I havn't caught the doodles yet...
    Doodlas: Try the nearby lake, there should be 2 doodles in the water. Once u caught them I will give you the bait
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: SpringBaitNPCComplete
---
    You: I have both doodles in my album now!
    Doodlas: Perfect! Here have this chocolate bird. CMGaTO is for sure playing Silkmusic but he can't resist that tasty bird.
    Doodlas: And they are not alive, so no one gets hurt!
    You: Thank you Doodlas! I'll get right on it
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

//--------------------------------
//     Autumn Bait NPC
//--------------------------------
title: AutumnBaitNPC
---
    Bellbottom: This bush is FULL of strawberrys. Now how does a doodle fish eat... I'm 2D...
    You: Hey! Could I have a strawberry?
    Bellbottom: So you want a strawberry from Bellbottoms marvelous berry bush.
    You: It's not yours... it's a wild bush....
    Bellbottom: Exactly, it has no owner so it's mine now!
    Narrator: Bellbottom shows you a certificate of ownership, it looks incredibly fake.
    You: How did you even get that paper?
    Bellbottom: Erm... Internet?
    You: Look I need to catch all the doodle fishes, can I just have one?
    Bellbottom: I am feeling generous so let's make a deal, show me you caught two of the fish in the river and I will give you one.
    Bellbottom: I know strawberry fish loves them and he doesn't leave his farm for anything but good berries
    Narrator: You don't understand how a farm can exist underwater but you accept the task and move on
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: AutumnBaitNPCIncomplete
---
    You: Can I just have the strawberry?
    Bellbottom: As you can see in the certificate of ownership, the bush is mine and I won't give you a berry until you show me 2 doodle fish from the river
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: AutumnBaitNPCComplete
---
    You: I have both doodles in my album now!
    Bellbottom: Well, you did it so I guess i have to follow the rules in the certificate!
    You: I still don't understand where did you manage to get that certificate
    Bellbottom: Erm... Amazon?
    Bellbottom: Anyways, here is your strawberry! This will for sure catch the attention of grandpa straw fish!
    You: Ok, thank you Bellbottom.
    Bellbottom: WAIT THIS DIPLOMA ISN'T STAMPED, ITS NOT LEGAL
    Narrator: You leave before he goes back on his word and takes your strawberry back.
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

//--------------------------------
//     Summer Bait NPC
//--------------------------------
title: SummerBaitNPC
---
    Bubbles: I know I can find some cool stuff in this sand. Everyone will know the name Bubbles the treasure hunter
    You: You're looking for treasure? Have you found anything?
    Bubbles: All I found so far has been shells and conches. I do know I can find something cool
    You: Want me to help you? I might find some bait for one of the doodles
    Bubbles: I have this rainbow glass but I want one to show off so I can look for another one.
    Bubbles: Why don't you spend some time caching the 2 fish at the sea shore and come back when you catch them.
    Bubbles: By that time I am sure to have found another rainbow glass.
    You: That seems perfect. Good luck finding treasure.
    Narrator: Bubbles goes back to slowly walking while looking down at the sand, all while doing "Beep Beep" sounds.
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

